  "limitations": [
    "Local cold browser contexts and uncompressed loopback transport; no WAN or device-fleet claim",
    "Startup starts before module import and ends at the first animation frame after both mounts; static fallback precedes import",
    "Update timings cover synchronous VM evaluation and DOM patching, not complete paint latency",
    "Heap qualification is post-GC JavaScript retention; it is not a proof of total native/WASM memory behavior",
    "Measured host interference covers the sentinel, outside draft, route and independent mount in the declared harness",
    "One startup observation is an upper bound including observer tool dispatch; it does not isolate first paint.",
    "Action duration includes CUA click, automatic scrolling and accessibility-tree observation; the declared inclusive action budget failed.",
    "Main process RSS excludes separately managed WebKit processes.",
    "No inference or provider operation occurred.",
    "The direct AX helper was unavailable; its original failure result remains retained separately.",
    "One development Mac, bounded 32-task/128-state application, five cold CLI/TUI samples; not a production SLO or fleet benchmark.",
    "The separate host action probe passed its fresh declaration but cannot clear the original failed CUA-inclusive desktop budget. Desktop performance remains experimental.",
    "No model calls, external effects or inference provider operations were performed by these measurements."
  ]
